      "n": 18,
      "topic": 3,
      "topicName": "Household bill",
      "measure": "M71–M73d",
      "what": "business, downtown, one mandate not a new office",
      "kind": "scored",
      "mark": "Partial",
      "value": 1,
      "quote": "I want to remove the barriers stopping people from coming downtown and restore the vibrant downtown that has been lost.",
      "why": "Commits to a downtown outcome with no instrument and no number: no vacancy target, no levers named, no mandate, no flagship event, no economic plan. Which barriers is never stated. Context: \"Without people in the economic and cultural heart of the city, we don't have a downtown,\" and, at launch, \"When local businesses are healthy, people have jobs.\"",
