      "what": "$25M referendum threshold, 5-step process, material-change rule",
      "kind": "scored",
      "mark": "Weak",
      "value": 0.5,
      "quote": "It shouldn't have taken a public outcry to stop the redevelopment of Centennial Square; a Council that listens and is engaged would have quickly realized it wasn't the right plan nor the right time.",
